# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets. Nothing below ever belongs in a commit.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.Production.json
*.pfx
*.key

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Company-specific assets — the reason this section exists is that HrDraft is
# open source but was built inside a company.
#
# The design bundle contains the originating company's logo files, its branded
# design sketch and screenshots of its website. None of that is HrDraft's to
# publish, and a push is hard to undo. It stays on disk for local reference.
#
# If you fork this and want your own brand assets tracked, delete these two
# rules — your logos are yours to commit.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
docs/**/design/
src/HrDraft.Web/public/assets/*
# The folder's own instructions stay tracked — otherwise a fresh clone gets an
# empty directory with no hint about what belongs in it.
!src/HrDraft.Web/public/assets/README.md

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Node / Vite
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
.vite/
*.local
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# The SPA build lands in the API's wwwroot — generated, never committed.
src/HrDraft.Api/wwwroot/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .NET
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vs/
TestResults/
*.coverage

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editors / OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json.example
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Claude Code — local permission grants are per-machine.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json
